      "document_id": "F04",
      "text": "Fixes and limits\n\n- The manager queue shows original and proposed attendance timelines side by side. Conflicting decisions return APPROVAL-409.\n- Payroll export mapping failures consistently return PAY-EXPORT-017.\n- TOIL and cash overtime rules are unchanged. Self-service does not unlock payroll, automatically pay extra attendance or expose medical attachments to managers.",
