      "text": "Shift swaps\n\nSwaps were manager-initiated. Employees asked the manager to arrange a trade; the manager checked both workers' agreement, team skills, rest, and hour limits, then reassigned both shifts. There was no employee Propose swap button or colleague acceptance timer. The resulting schedule still required 11 consecutive hours of rest.",
